# Web-side Supabase Auth (Track B). Copy to web/.env.local (gitignored by Next.js).
# Leave BOTH unset to run the front door on the honest 0000 stub against a header-mode API.
# Values: Supabase dashboard → Project settings → API. The anon key is PUBLIC by design
# (it only lets a browser talk to Auth; every data call still goes through the Meyy API).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<ref>.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon public key>
